    "summary": "Blinding Radiance protects either 1 of your INFANTRY units that the attacker picked or a friendly JUMP PACK unit up to 3″ away from it. Both options require ADEPTA SORORITAS. For the rest of the phase, attacks against the chosen unit take −1 to hit. Selecting JUMP PACK extends that penalty to attacks against friendly Sororitas INFANTRY up to 3″ from the chosen unit.",
